## Recipe 4: Refund a Previous Sale

```kotlin
fun refund(originalTxnId: String, amountCents: Long) {
    val request = RefundRequest.referencedBuilder()
        .setTransactionRequestId("TXN_${System.currentTimeMillis()}")
        .setOriginalTransactionId(originalTxnId)
        .setAmount(AmountInfo(BigDecimal(amountCents), "USD"))
        .build()

    TaplinkSDK.getClient().refund(request, paymentCallback)
}
